  "description": "A desirable man with wealth, ability, devilish charm, and a shining appearance called a masterpiece painstakingly created by God, the successor of Mayoon Group, Ma Sung-Hoon. However, he had a fatal weakness that women detest. Kang Deok-Sim, a woman who was sent to put to rest the rumors surrounding Sung-Hoon that his lower body was bad, that he was a eunuch, and that he was gay. Starting today, she must be reborn as a picky and boring middle-aged female secretary and survive by his side. For 1 billion and to see his handsome face!\n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
